    "name": "The Mildew Children: Chapter 1",
    "steam_appid": 2420330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/adfad1fae888fa317db18fb938325c4e.poster.avif?t=1729333620\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/adfad1fae888fa317db18fb938325c4e.webm?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/adfad1fae888fa317db18fb938325c4e.mp4?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/d009d4bc6438cc5679b5d92a09273b5e.avif?t=1729333620\" /></span><br>Featuring a blend of 2D adventure and visual novel, The Mildew Children: Chapter 1 is the very beginning of the grim tale about a village inhabited only by children who follow savage pagan traditions. Guide a young witch named Kyrphel, along with her sisters and make sure they survive the macabre Ritual in order to save the village. A witch's demise during the ritual is not extraordinary, since not all can triumph over Mistress Death. This time, Kyrphel is strong enough to handle it. Or so she thought.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/4db8c0f2883dd1103299a396b3fe44e5.poster.avif?t=1729333620\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/4db8c0f2883dd1103299a396b3fe44e5.webm?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/4db8c0f2883dd1103299a396b3fe44e5.mp4?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Combining the elements of fairy tale and horror, the story draws on pagan folklore and ancient beliefs. Accompany Kyrphel and her friends in this grim, beautifully hand-drawn adventure game. Take part in the Ritual and discover the secret of the village, interact with peculiar villagers, bewitch, and overcome the affliction that haunts the young sorceress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/e747fcae67e161a44fc58d91c559b6fc.avif?t=1729333620\" /></span><br>- A full chapter of the origin story that introduces the player to local traditions and sets the stage for the adventure that follows.<br><br>- Approximately 1 hour of narrative and gameplay combining investigations, puzzles, quick-time events (QTE) and multiple-choice dialogues.<br><br>- The variety of unique locations: the village streets, the burial ground, the RItual.<br><br>- A series of tough decisions that will force you to think twice about how you proceed - will you go against ancient traditions or follow them to the end?<br><br>- Characters with a detailed personality and story, unique portraits reflecting the characters' emotions during dialogues. Numerous side characters Kyrphel would have to interact with in order to fulfill her goals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/a2beb56d553c86ec1c0c27aa33958b31.poster.avif?t=1729333620\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/a2beb56d553c86ec1c0c27aa33958b31.webm?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/a2beb56d553c86ec1c0c27aa33958b31.mp4?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/adfad1fae888fa317db18fb938325c4e.poster.avif?t=1729333620\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/adfad1fae888fa317db18fb938325c4e.webm?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/adfad1fae888fa317db18fb938325c4e.mp4?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/d009d4bc6438cc5679b5d92a09273b5e.avif?t=1729333620\" /></span><br>Featuring a blend of 2D adventure and visual novel, The Mildew Children: Chapter 1 is the very beginning of the grim tale about a village inhabited only by children who follow savage pagan traditions. Guide a young witch named Kyrphel, along with her sisters and make sure they survive the macabre Ritual in order to save the village. A witch's demise during the ritual is not extraordinary, since not all can triumph over Mistress Death. This time, Kyrphel is strong enough to handle it. Or so she thought.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/4db8c0f2883dd1103299a396b3fe44e5.poster.avif?t=1729333620\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/4db8c0f2883dd1103299a396b3fe44e5.webm?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/4db8c0f2883dd1103299a396b3fe44e5.mp4?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Combining the elements of fairy tale and horror, the story draws on pagan folklore and ancient beliefs. Accompany Kyrphel and her friends in this grim, beautifully hand-drawn adventure game. Take part in the Ritual and discover the secret of the village, interact with peculiar villagers, bewitch, and overcome the affliction that haunts the young sorceress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/e747fcae67e161a44fc58d91c559b6fc.avif?t=1729333620\" /></span><br>- A full chapter of the origin story that introduces the player to local traditions and sets the stage for the adventure that follows.<br><br>- Approximately 1 hour of narrative and gameplay combining investigations, puzzles, quick-time events (QTE) and multiple-choice dialogues.<br><br>- The variety of unique locations: the village streets, the burial ground, the RItual.<br><br>- A series of tough decisions that will force you to think twice about how you proceed - will you go against ancient traditions or follow them to the end?<br><br>- Characters with a detailed personality and story, unique portraits reflecting the characters' emotions during dialogues. Numerous side characters Kyrphel would have to interact with in order to fulfill her goals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/a2beb56d553c86ec1c0c27aa33958b31.poster.avif?t=1729333620\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/a2beb56d553c86ec1c0c27aa33958b31.webm?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420330/extras/a2beb56d553c86ec1c0c27aa33958b31.mp4?t=1729333620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
